## Audit / freeze note

This archive is frozen at render time. Its client-side search and year navigation operate over fixed embedded content and fetch nothing. The rendered HTML reads the local token mirror synced into the bundle (or tokens inlined at seal time), not a live upstream URL.

To re-render against newer upstream tokens or a longer span, re-sync the mirror, record a new commit SHA, and regenerate — **reusing the participant → role mapping above**. The previous archive remains valid for audit at its recorded SHA. Regeneration produces a new artifact; supersession is history, not deletion.
